          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-190350-f071c0bf5d2c/candidates/0/1",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MINOR. The Dream sizing bullet hardcodes the engine formula, though it says to verify against the engine. Its cited trigger (2026-10-08T14:58Z) supports it. The bullet is restrictive and grants nothing new.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-190350-f071c0bf5d2c/candidates/0/1/claim/19",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-190350-f071c0bf5d2c/candidates/0/1",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MINOR. \"At least twice its last observed runtime\" is testable, since ~456 s gives ≥912 s. It extends compute time but not the approved spending, and it matches DOG-036.",
