      "text": "BLOCKING (ambiguous or contradictory, so untestable). The owner-authorization bullet says to pass the authorization to workers verbatim, but it also says the authorization \"never waives third-party terms\". The S2 trigger (2026-10-09T09:35Z) was an owner authorization to fetch data that the repository README restricts. As written, a worker or reviewer cannot tell whether the quoted authorization is effective for fetching or is void. Also, \"excerpt ... keeps the scope words\" has no objective check.",
